WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 2=

01:50.940 --> 01:51.500
Hello, Mei.

01:51.940 --> 01:52.700
I'll be home later.

01:52.777 --> 01:54.140
I need to take care of something.

01:54.200 --> 01:55.533
Don't wait for me for dinner.

01:55.540 --> 01:56.060
Okay, bye.

01:59.620 --> 02:00.060
Li Weifeng.

02:06.780 --> 02:09.900
(Shattered Six States update)

02:19.380 --> 02:20.940
(Chapter 285,
The Sea of Glass, latest update)

02:20.940 --> 02:22.622
(Chapter 284,
Vessel of Immortality, latest update)

02:28.620 --> 02:30.460
(Shattered Six States
Chapter 285, The Sea of Glass)

02:30.460 --> 02:32.100
So, you mean shared memories?

02:33.711 --> 02:35.330
(Year 2023)
Like the male and female leads

02:35.355 --> 02:36.133
having twin souls?

02:37.533 --> 02:39.380
I think the male lead
discovered it first,

02:39.460 --> 02:40.822
but he didn't tell the female lead.

02:40.888 --> 02:42.380
She only found out later on her own.

02:44.460 --> 02:46.444
But even if she finds out,
she might not agree.

02:47.900 --> 02:48.820
If it were me,

02:49.180 --> 02:50.500
I wouldn't want

02:50.622 --> 02:52.740
to share something
like soul memories with anyone.

02:55.020 --> 02:56.340
She might agree in the end,

02:56.540 --> 02:57.420
but it would

02:58.340 --> 03:00.020
be a painful process.

03:04.900 --> 03:06.900
At least the pain gets shared.

03:07.620 --> 03:08.580
Pain can't be shared,

03:09.940 --> 03:11.420
but at least someone can understand

03:11.980 --> 03:12.860
that your pain

03:13.180 --> 03:14.540
is truly felt by someone else.

03:21.220 --> 03:21.780
Come on.

03:21.780 --> 03:22.490
What are you doing?

03:22.500 --> 03:23.780
Let's go.

03:23.780 --> 03:24.660
Put me down.

03:35.540 --> 03:36.460
That was so well said.

03:37.260 --> 03:38.220
I have to write it down.

03:40.900 --> 03:41.780
Are you childish?

03:42.540 --> 03:43.300
You're right.

03:43.500 --> 03:44.420
Why write it down now?

03:44.420 --> 03:45.140
Write it tomorrow.

03:45.140 --> 03:45.700
Feel it first.

03:45.700 --> 03:46.700
Don't come over.

03:46.700 --> 03:47.866
- Don't come over.
- Too late. Feel it.

03:47.940 --> 03:48.700
I'm in pain.

03:48.700 --> 03:49.660
You feel it with me.

04:04.755 --> 04:06.620
I didn't expect
your wife to be like this.

04:08.500 --> 04:09.940
I know she's an educated person.

04:11.333 --> 04:12.580
The reason I ignored you before

04:12.711 --> 04:14.711
was that I didn't want
to hurt an innocent person.

04:15.980 --> 04:18.888
But when I met her, I didn't expect her
to speak to me like that.

04:20.740 --> 04:22.060
Your life must not be easy.

04:22.140 --> 04:23.300
I can divorce her,

04:24.422 --> 04:25.460
and leave with nothing.

04:28.700 --> 04:29.420
If you...

04:34.500 --> 04:35.580
I can do anything.

04:41.100 --> 04:42.820
You worked so hard to earn the money.

04:43.422 --> 04:45.755
Walking away with
nothing would be such a waste.

04:48.140 --> 04:48.660
Of course,

04:50.060 --> 04:51.380
I can earn my own money too.

04:52.020 --> 04:53.020
I'm not after your money.

04:54.700 --> 04:55.540
But if your marriage

04:55.540 --> 04:56.900
is really that difficult,

04:58.460 --> 05:00.020
you should still make preparations

05:00.222 --> 05:02.066
for the transfer and division of assets.

05:02.820 --> 05:04.060
You make a good point.

05:05.060 --> 05:06.300
I haven't thought that far yet.

05:08.900 --> 05:09.900
I know a lawyer.

05:10.777 --> 05:12.733
I can recommend one
to you when the time comes.

05:12.755 --> 05:13.933
You can get a consultation.

05:14.380 --> 05:15.511
Better to be prepared.

05:16.288 --> 05:17.133
What do you think?

05:18.100 --> 05:18.460
Okay.

05:23.300 --> 05:24.660
I kind of don't know what to say.

05:25.377 --> 05:26.933
Just keep the right mindset.

05:28.444 --> 05:29.644
Keep the right mindset.

05:32.022 --> 05:32.800
Let's go.

05:42.660 --> 05:43.266
It's a mess.

05:43.980 --> 05:44.300
Alright.

05:45.140 --> 05:45.900
I'm a bit nervous.

05:46.180 --> 05:46.900
Don't be nervous.

05:57.260 --> 05:57.620
This way.

06:29.140 --> 06:29.940
Mr. He Han.

06:46.060 --> 06:46.780
Mr. He Han.

06:47.100 --> 06:48.140
Just call me Lily.

06:48.500 --> 06:49.500
I'm 23 this year.

06:50.580 --> 06:51.580
Chen Zheng, 24.

06:51.666 --> 06:52.733
Hello, Mr. He Han.

06:58.220 --> 06:59.740
What do you usually read?

07:00.940 --> 07:01.500
I'll go first.

07:02.820 --> 07:05.140
I like One Hundred Years of Solitude,

07:06.311 --> 07:07.380
Temple of Earth and I,

07:07.780 --> 07:09.620
and I also quite like The Little Prince.

07:12.180 --> 07:14.460
Your range is quite wide, huh?

07:14.940 --> 07:15.460
Oh?

07:23.933 --> 07:24.911
What about you?

07:25.860 --> 07:27.540
I prefer short stories.

07:28.060 --> 07:29.380
Short stories are interesting.

07:29.620 --> 07:30.380
What do you read?

07:30.940 --> 07:32.100
My favorite

07:32.244 --> 07:33.600
is The Old Man and the Sea.

07:37.340 --> 07:37.900
You two,

07:38.260 --> 07:39.220
I'm really sorry,

07:39.420 --> 07:41.140
but please go back and tell Mr. Fan

07:41.780 --> 07:42.660
we're not a good fit.

07:42.660 --> 07:44.490
Your tastes are too highbrow.

07:44.490 --> 07:45.860
I'm just an online fiction author.

07:46.140 --> 07:47.155
I can't handle something

07:47.160 --> 07:49.022
on the level
of One Hundred Years of Solitude.

07:52.340 --> 07:53.060
Thank you.

07:57.380 --> 07:58.180
What a coincidence.

07:58.620 --> 07:59.500
Let me introduce you.

07:59.500 --> 08:01.133
This is my former editor, Lin Zhanqiao.

08:01.140 --> 08:01.780
She's great.

08:01.822 --> 08:03.700
She never talks about things like
One Hundred Years of Solitude

08:03.700 --> 08:04.733
or The Old Man and the Sea.

08:04.755 --> 08:06.780
She only cares about
whether there's space in my room

08:06.780 --> 08:08.688
for her toothbrush,
slippers, and pillow.

08:09.911 --> 08:11.200
Why don't you come on in?

08:48.620 --> 08:49.380
Hey, Zhao Lanxin.

08:50.460 --> 08:52.340
If Shattered Six States
is sold to Mr. Fan,

08:52.460 --> 08:53.340
how much can he offer?

08:54.140 --> 08:55.020
How much do I get?

08:58.980 --> 08:59.740
Alright, got it.

09:10.100 --> 09:10.700
Hello, Mr. Fan.

09:11.420 --> 09:12.100
If you want

09:13.420 --> 09:14.380
Shattered Six States,

09:14.940 --> 09:16.540
add another five million to your offer.

09:17.140 --> 09:18.620
If you agree, we have a deal.

09:23.740 --> 09:24.888
You can think about it.

09:27.740 --> 09:28.100
Bye.

09:32.460 --> 09:33.100
Congratulations

09:34.460 --> 09:35.500
in every way.

09:40.140 --> 09:42.340
The three words that waste
the most feelings and effort

09:42.980 --> 09:43.820
are "can't let go."

10:07.940 --> 10:08.300
Hello?

10:08.320 --> 10:09.500
Lin Zhanqiao, you wouldn't really...

10:09.500 --> 10:11.260
That's right. I called Mr. Fan.

10:11.460 --> 10:12.060
I agreed.

10:14.022 --> 10:15.177
Five million more.

10:16.466 --> 10:18.540
Everything I've done for
the company over the years

10:18.660 --> 10:20.220
is worth earning
that extra five million.

10:21.155 --> 10:23.000
And of course, you should thank me.

10:23.660 --> 10:24.660
No matter where it's said,

10:25.140 --> 10:26.780
I just raised
your value by five million.

10:57.400 --> 10:58.777
(From childhood to now,)

10:59.740 --> 11:01.220
(we learned in the classroom)

11:02.100 --> 11:03.460
(how to make new friends,)

11:04.500 --> 11:05.700
(how to welcome a new life,)

11:06.533 --> 11:08.133
(and how to gain new knowledge.)

11:10.300 --> 11:10.820
(And now,)

11:12.260 --> 11:15.300
(life has used a long farewell)

11:16.660 --> 11:18.780
(to teach me how
to let go of old attachments.)

11:26.380 --> 11:27.380
♪Never Stop♪

11:27.780 --> 11:28.740
♪Never Stop♪

11:28.740 --> 11:32.220
(Shattered Six States)

11:32.220 --> 11:32.860
♪Never Stop♪

11:32.860 --> 11:33.980
♪Watch my words come alive in bloom♪

11:33.980 --> 11:35.570
♪Unleash six states in a chain of blows♪

11:35.580 --> 11:36.780
♪See a genius born to soar♪

11:36.780 --> 11:38.280
♪Rising high where the wide skies glow♪

11:38.340 --> 11:39.540
♪If you can catch my shadow♪

11:39.540 --> 11:40.940
♪You can cross the world and roam free♪

11:40.940 --> 11:42.540
(Dingqi Reading secures exclusive
rights to Shattered Six States)

11:42.540 --> 11:44.020
(Editor's Office)

11:44.700 --> 11:46.100
♪Lighting up every hidden place♪

11:46.340 --> 11:47.820
♪I once climbed rooftops all alone♪

11:47.820 --> 11:48.860
♪Searching for the stars above♪

11:48.860 --> 11:50.300
♪Until I saw your eyes aglow♪

11:50.420 --> 11:51.420
♪Shining through the city lights♪

11:51.460 --> 11:52.666
(Responsible editor, Lin Zhanqiao)

11:52.820 --> 11:54.180
♪The legend I had chased all along♪

11:54.180 --> 11:57.620
♪Never Stop♪

12:16.860 --> 12:17.540
Having noodles?

12:24.100 --> 12:24.460
Look.

12:24.820 --> 12:25.622
This is for you.

12:26.380 --> 12:27.540
We're family now,

12:27.666 --> 12:29.244
so no need to be polite with me.

12:30.060 --> 12:31.260
I've kept this for many years.

12:31.333 --> 12:32.955
I couldn't even
bring myself to drink it.

12:33.820 --> 12:34.380
Take it.

12:35.260 --> 12:37.180
When Shattered Six States is finished,

12:37.540 --> 12:38.860
open it and celebrate properly.

12:39.177 --> 12:40.422
What would you like to eat?

12:40.460 --> 12:41.140
I'll pass.

12:42.300 --> 12:43.200
Just a glass of water.

12:44.422 --> 12:45.580
I've been talking all day,

12:45.740 --> 12:46.500
and I'm parched.

12:49.420 --> 12:51.500
As soon as news of
our partnership went public,

12:51.740 --> 12:53.340
it's been non-stop interviews

12:54.220 --> 12:56.180
and people lining up

12:56.340 --> 12:57.955
to negotiate film and TV rights.

12:59.500 --> 13:00.060
How about you?

13:00.740 --> 13:02.140
Have you found your editor?

13:02.540 --> 13:03.020
Yes.

13:03.620 --> 13:04.180
Already?

13:04.820 --> 13:05.820
What kind of person

13:05.820 --> 13:06.940
would meet your standards?

13:08.620 --> 13:09.220
Do I know them?

13:09.780 --> 13:10.180
You do.

13:10.511 --> 13:10.980
Who is it?

13:11.355 --> 13:12.533
You'll see in a moment.

13:16.340 --> 13:16.940
Fan.

13:17.460 --> 13:18.020
He Han.

13:23.820 --> 13:24.780
Why are you back?

13:25.780 --> 13:27.020
Weren't you in Singapore?

13:27.222 --> 13:29.355
I'm not staying there anymore.
I came back yesterday.

13:31.700 --> 13:33.530
You came back with your husband?

13:33.530 --> 13:35.260
He didn't come back. I came back alone.

13:35.940 --> 13:36.420
Divorced.

13:38.620 --> 13:39.540
Again?

13:39.820 --> 13:40.660
So is that illegal?

13:44.060 --> 13:44.540
It's her?

13:45.600 --> 13:47.155
I was the one who looked for him.

13:47.533 --> 13:49.177
Didn't you just get back yesterday?

13:49.266 --> 13:49.822
Yes.

13:50.044 --> 13:51.260
As soon as I got back, I heard

13:51.260 --> 13:53.533
the big news about
Shattered Six States changing hands.

13:53.900 --> 13:55.580
So I called He Han.

13:55.860 --> 13:57.580
He needs an editor, and I need a job.

13:57.755 --> 13:58.933
It worked out perfectly.

14:01.340 --> 14:02.940
How could you hire her?

14:03.511 --> 14:04.860
How did you even agree on this?

14:04.860 --> 14:06.200
How much are you paying her?

14:07.220 --> 14:08.700
Let me tell you,

14:09.140 --> 14:10.700
this woman only cares about money.

14:11.300 --> 14:12.580
I've seen it first-hand.

14:12.860 --> 14:14.370
Don't say I didn't warn you.

14:14.370 --> 14:15.180
Watch what you say.

14:20.060 --> 14:22.380
Ms. Lin, guess who
He Han picked as his editor?

14:22.460 --> 14:23.444
Not interested.

14:23.740 --> 14:24.580
Just guess the age.

14:24.800 --> 14:25.800
I'm talking about age.

14:26.100 --> 14:27.140
Start training her at 18,

14:27.140 --> 14:28.170
and ten years later she will be 28.

14:28.170 --> 14:30.111
- That's one way to go about it.
- Forty-six.

14:32.580 --> 14:33.100
Who is it?

14:34.020 --> 14:34.460
Dai Shan.

14:35.660 --> 14:36.580
Mr. Fan's ex-wife?

14:37.820 --> 14:38.260
Wasn't she

14:39.060 --> 14:40.700
with some businessman in Singapore?

14:40.860 --> 14:41.500
Divorced.

14:41.900 --> 14:43.660
She's back to her old line of work.

14:46.222 --> 14:47.155
It costs a bit more,

14:47.422 --> 14:48.355
but she's not bad.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.200
Hello, Mr. Ling.

15:10.488 --> 15:12.177
What is it that had
to be discussed outside?

15:12.660 --> 15:14.020
When will Mr. Fan's money arrive?

15:14.220 --> 15:15.020
Within a week.

15:20.311 --> 15:21.860
The company was founded by three of us.

15:22.660 --> 15:24.380
Back then,
we gave Zhanqiao an equal share

15:24.780 --> 15:25.940
because she had He Han.

15:26.444 --> 15:27.466
Now that it's sold,

15:27.511 --> 15:28.780
she's not that important anymore.

15:29.088 --> 15:30.022
What do you think?

15:30.155 --> 15:31.311
What do you want to do?

15:31.620 --> 15:32.740
Reduce her shareholding.

15:37.260 --> 15:37.940
On what grounds?

15:40.220 --> 15:41.140
That's your job.

15:53.860 --> 15:55.860
(Half A Month Later)

16:00.820 --> 16:01.860
(Shattered Six States
real-time popularity)

16:01.860 --> 16:02.940
(Bestseller List Daily Rank 01)

16:02.940 --> 16:03.980
(Global Ranking 01)

16:03.980 --> 16:06.420
(Dingqi Reading Platform,
Daily Rank, Shattered Six States)

16:06.420 --> 16:07.180
Qingshan Moran.

16:07.577 --> 16:08.266
Over here.

16:09.860 --> 16:10.580
Fluorescent Light.

16:13.100 --> 16:13.940
Flowers Ate Zhuge.

16:14.220 --> 16:14.620
Here.

16:16.340 --> 16:16.980
Old Hand.

16:19.740 --> 16:20.500
Mosquito Water Ice.

16:23.700 --> 16:24.580
One Penny Gentleman.

16:27.777 --> 16:29.100
First of all, congratulations.

16:29.180 --> 16:30.980
You've stood out among 170 people

16:31.111 --> 16:32.688
and now have the chance to become

16:32.755 --> 16:34.420
a new author working with Chenxing.

16:39.020 --> 16:40.220
What does that mean?

16:40.500 --> 16:41.180
Nothing much.

16:41.980 --> 16:42.540
Does it work?

16:43.260 --> 16:44.066
Hard to say.

16:45.780 --> 16:47.060
What I'm about to send you

16:47.600 --> 16:49.600
is the project brief
we'll be working on.

16:51.500 --> 16:53.222
The story concept
belongs to the company,

16:53.230 --> 16:55.470
and it's already been
officially registered and protected.

16:56.140 --> 16:58.355
One author will be
selected from the six of you.

16:58.980 --> 17:00.060
The sections marked in red

17:00.220 --> 17:02.260
are what you need to take home, write,

17:02.500 --> 17:03.540
and submit back to me.

17:03.980 --> 17:05.622
Each of you has a different part.

17:06.100 --> 17:06.900
Three days.

17:07.266 --> 17:08.844
I need at least 50,000 words.

17:09.466 --> 17:11.010
Fifty thousand?

17:11.010 --> 17:11.900
In three days?

17:12.220 --> 17:13.288
You heard that right.

17:13.377 --> 17:14.380
Fifty thousand words.

17:14.533 --> 17:16.160
Writing online fiction is physical work.

17:16.420 --> 17:17.380
Under any circumstances,

17:17.500 --> 17:19.780
you must maintain
both output and quality.

17:20.133 --> 17:21.650
If you can't write 10,000 words a day,

17:21.650 --> 17:23.340
you won't even make it through my door.

17:24.460 --> 17:25.540
If it's padded writing,

17:25.940 --> 17:26.980
I'll still show you out.

17:28.140 --> 17:29.700
Since you've chosen this line of work,

17:29.820 --> 17:31.540
you'll be evaluated every single day.

17:31.700 --> 17:33.600
Out of more than 20 million
online fiction authors,

17:33.688 --> 17:36.288
you have to break into the top 20
just to be seen and remembered.

17:38.420 --> 17:40.020
One out of six will be chosen.

17:40.780 --> 17:41.340
Which means

17:41.340 --> 17:43.220
everyone sitting across from you
and beside you

17:43.220 --> 17:44.180
is your competition.

17:45.420 --> 17:46.060
In a moment,

17:46.060 --> 17:47.740
I will introduce your assigned editors.

17:49.300 --> 17:50.100
Fragile.

17:50.620 --> 17:51.100
Mantou.

17:51.260 --> 17:51.820
Naobaijin.

17:52.420 --> 17:54.933
You can choose for yourselves
who you want to work with.

17:55.888 --> 17:56.780
I have a question.

17:57.180 --> 17:59.066
This project we're
benchmarking against...

17:59.340 --> 18:01.980
What genre and tier does it fall under?

18:02.180 --> 18:03.020
Fantasy cultivation.

18:03.700 --> 18:04.340
A top-tier work.

18:04.844 --> 18:06.466
Something like Shattered Six States.

18:06.900 --> 18:08.020
It's already a massive hit.

18:08.100 --> 18:09.020
I don't want imitation.

18:10.500 --> 18:12.260
I want your own voice.

18:32.444 --> 18:33.300
This author is the one

18:33.420 --> 18:35.300
who previously
wrote The Desert Rises to Fame.

18:35.700 --> 18:36.460
How old is he?

18:37.020 --> 18:38.340
How old...

18:38.500 --> 18:39.020
No idea.

18:39.380 --> 18:40.140
Is there a photo?

18:40.420 --> 18:40.980
Let me check.

18:41.900 --> 18:42.780
A photo...

18:46.820 --> 18:48.140
Miss, could I borrow the vinegar?

18:51.980 --> 18:52.780
Found it.

18:53.780 --> 18:54.490
So handsome.

18:54.490 --> 18:54.860
Right?

18:54.860 --> 18:55.620
Is he married?

18:55.820 --> 18:56.420
No idea.

18:56.500 --> 18:57.540
He's really handsome.

19:01.222 --> 19:03.177
He looks like the one
who just borrowed the vinegar.

19:06.340 --> 19:07.100
Mr. He Han,

19:07.220 --> 19:08.420
can I take a photo with you?

19:08.700 --> 19:09.460
Of course. Come on.

19:11.100 --> 19:11.700
Thank you.

19:14.820 --> 19:15.660
It's a rare chance.

19:15.660 --> 19:16.780
Let's take one together.

19:16.780 --> 19:17.600
- Sure. Really?
- Alright?

19:17.620 --> 19:18.260
One, two, three.

19:22.700 --> 19:24.940
(Dingqi Reading Platform)

19:24.940 --> 19:28.140
(Shattered Six States Promotion Event)

19:36.180 --> 19:36.660
How is it?

19:37.540 --> 19:38.380
You can see

19:39.100 --> 19:40.580
our sincerity, right?

19:41.780 --> 19:43.420
Just have him show his face.

19:44.088 --> 19:46.060
Consider it doing
our platform a favor, alright?

19:46.260 --> 19:47.620
He agreed to a video call.

19:48.180 --> 19:49.540
Just a video call?

19:52.580 --> 19:54.380
There's also an interview later.

19:54.540 --> 19:55.540
Have him talk about

19:55.860 --> 19:58.060
his contract termination
with Chenxing and Lin Zhanqiao.

19:58.177 --> 19:59.220
That's a private matter.

19:59.755 --> 20:01.140
It's not convenient for him to answer.

20:01.140 --> 20:02.420
Next, we'll switch the camera to

20:02.420 --> 20:04.260
Mr. He Han,
the author of Shattered Six States.

20:04.311 --> 20:05.940
(Shattered Six States Special Promotion)
Thank you to everyone here.

20:06.380 --> 20:08.540
Thank you for
supporting Shattered Six States.

20:09.420 --> 20:10.100
Mr. He Han,

20:10.100 --> 20:11.540
you're as distinctive as ever.

20:11.540 --> 20:13.100
With the success
of Shattered Six States,

20:13.100 --> 20:15.100
do you have any secrets
to share with everyone?

20:16.500 --> 20:17.340
Love life.

20:17.980 --> 20:18.660
Sleep more.

20:19.340 --> 20:20.380
Eat hot food.

20:20.460 --> 20:22.100
I heard your event serves cold dishes,

20:22.100 --> 20:22.860
so I didn't go.

20:23.780 --> 20:24.260
Also,

20:24.940 --> 20:26.580
learn to appreciate beautiful things,

20:26.688 --> 20:27.900
especially beautiful women.

20:28.580 --> 20:30.780
Mr. He Han, you're so humorous,
and entertaining.

20:30.780 --> 20:31.900
I'm serious.

20:32.060 --> 20:34.020
Mr. He Han, have you just had lunch?

20:34.820 --> 20:35.140
Yes.

20:35.580 --> 20:36.860
Brunch.

20:37.380 --> 20:39.460
Will you be joining our
round-table discussion later?

20:40.620 --> 20:41.260
I can't.

20:41.377 --> 20:42.460
I need to go buy a car.

20:43.660 --> 20:44.500
What kind of car?

20:45.066 --> 20:46.140
I made some money, right?

20:46.244 --> 20:47.400
So, it's something expensive.

20:50.620 --> 20:52.380
Sir, this is our top configuration.

20:52.700 --> 20:53.700
If you're interested,

20:53.700 --> 20:55.560
we can arrange
a test drive registration for you.

20:55.666 --> 20:56.900
How long before delivery?

20:57.577 --> 20:59.680
That depends on your configuration
and payment method.

20:59.820 --> 21:01.580
Generally, it takes six to eight weeks.

21:01.688 --> 21:02.480
I'll take this one.

21:02.540 --> 21:03.820
The top configuration.

21:04.060 --> 21:04.844
I want it today.

21:06.220 --> 21:07.890
I'll need to confirm with the manager.

21:07.890 --> 21:08.711
No need to confirm.

21:08.780 --> 21:09.500
Where do I pay?

21:43.466 --> 21:45.760
All the platform's resources
went to Shattered Six States.

21:45.940 --> 21:47.980
The few novels we launched last week

21:48.500 --> 21:49.660
barely made any impact.

21:50.688 --> 21:52.822
Dingqi Reading's funds
have already come in.

21:53.260 --> 21:55.180
Speaking of which,
we should thank Lin Zhanqiao.

21:55.340 --> 21:57.200
She got an extra
five million from Mr. Fan.

21:57.600 --> 21:59.860
I've nearly finalized the company's
new round of financing.

21:59.900 --> 22:01.422
The process will start next month.

22:08.177 --> 22:09.600
So, have you figured it out?

22:09.822 --> 22:11.933
How to persuade her
to reduce her shareholding?

22:12.133 --> 22:14.266
We need to do it
before the funding comes in.

22:15.420 --> 22:15.860
I haven't.

22:20.620 --> 22:21.780
When He Han was here,

22:21.780 --> 22:23.577
every novel she worked on became a hit.

22:23.780 --> 22:24.860
Now that he's gone,

22:25.420 --> 22:27.020
if she can't produce another He Han,

22:27.500 --> 22:28.970
her reputation

22:28.970 --> 22:30.377
as a top promoter and top editor

22:30.540 --> 22:31.733
will have to be given back.

22:31.820 --> 22:33.660
I also heard the platform returned

22:33.660 --> 22:35.780
the film rights for
At the End of Yue Lu Lights

22:36.100 --> 22:38.400
and raised the price
to acquire Shattered Six States.

22:38.740 --> 22:40.780
We're losing on both ends now.

22:41.288 --> 22:43.760
And you're still not considering
having her reduce her shares?

22:45.060 --> 22:46.460
What I'm considering is

22:46.622 --> 22:47.555
having her leave.

23:09.260 --> 23:10.780
But she founded the company.

23:11.220 --> 23:12.940
She can keep the name Chenxing,

23:13.580 --> 23:14.740
but everything else, I take.

23:25.300 --> 23:26.900
You two are classmates. I'm not.

23:27.000 --> 23:29.688
You can choose to stand with your
classmate through thick and thin,

23:29.770 --> 23:31.955
and I can take the new funding
and start something new.

23:33.311 --> 23:34.420
On one side is friendship,

23:35.266 --> 23:36.533
and on the other is the market.

23:37.340 --> 23:39.180
You still have a choice.

23:46.100 --> 23:46.940
Let's call it a day.

23:47.580 --> 23:48.740
Go back and prepare well.

23:49.220 --> 23:49.980
Lin Zhanqiao!

23:50.022 --> 23:50.844
What are you doing?

23:50.866 --> 23:51.980
You're using your authors!

23:52.220 --> 23:53.000
What are you doing?

23:53.288 --> 23:54.533
You'll get what's coming to you!

24:00.260 --> 24:01.060
A new author, right?

24:02.580 --> 24:02.860
Sit.

24:09.620 --> 24:10.140
What is this?

24:11.420 --> 24:13.488
You promised you'd
let me write this novel.

24:14.244 --> 24:15.888
Why did you give it to someone else?

24:25.444 --> 24:27.866
This is the author
of At the End of Yue Lu Lights,

24:27.911 --> 24:28.955
Zhugan Dalan.

24:29.133 --> 24:31.888
He also stood out among several
candidates in a writing trial before.

24:31.900 --> 24:33.660
I'll use him as an example for you.

24:35.140 --> 24:36.380
The performance of

24:36.466 --> 24:39.311
At the End of Yue Lu Lights did not
meet the company's expectations.

24:39.400 --> 24:40.555
So, the company has decided

24:40.560 --> 24:42.333
to terminate collaboration
on his next project.

24:42.340 --> 24:43.755
It was planned for 1,200 chapters.

24:44.140 --> 24:45.460
I've already completed 400,

24:45.460 --> 24:47.222
and there are
still two-thirds unfinished.

24:47.300 --> 24:48.340
How is that not meeting the requirement?

24:48.340 --> 24:50.888
Four hundred chapters published
and still no recognition.

24:51.140 --> 24:51.900
That means

24:52.740 --> 24:54.780
I won't continue
to waste time on this project.

24:55.740 --> 24:56.860
If you want to continue,

24:57.111 --> 24:57.700
that's fine.

24:57.700 --> 24:59.140
I can assign you a different project.

25:00.940 --> 25:02.140
But if you don't,

25:02.400 --> 25:03.955
whether you terminate the contract

25:03.980 --> 25:05.066
or leave it unfinished,

25:05.300 --> 25:06.100
I have no objection.

25:09.020 --> 25:09.820
Lin Zhanqiao,

25:12.460 --> 25:14.660
you can't expect everyone to be He Han.

25:14.660 --> 25:15.777
You're overthinking it.

25:16.820 --> 25:18.700
I only expect
to see you on the front page

25:18.700 --> 25:19.530
of the rankings.

25:19.530 --> 25:21.180
But you haven't even achieved that.

25:30.660 --> 25:31.020
She

25:32.900 --> 25:34.260
will sign you at a very low price

25:34.577 --> 25:36.300
and then make you
work for her every day.

25:36.500 --> 25:37.540
Ten thousand words a day.

25:38.580 --> 25:39.420
Not just for one day.

25:39.420 --> 25:40.500
Every single day.

25:41.740 --> 25:43.180
I've written for a whole year.

25:43.688 --> 25:45.380
She would think you're not good enough.

25:46.180 --> 25:48.940
And by not good enough,
she means you can't compare to He Han.

25:50.260 --> 25:51.660
You didn't write your way

25:51.780 --> 25:54.020
to making her a star editor
like what He Han did.

25:54.177 --> 25:55.777
Which of you can compare to He Han?

25:56.060 --> 25:57.020
She is a jerk!

25:57.620 --> 25:59.490
If I were you, I'd walk out right now.

25:59.490 --> 26:01.155
You can all think it over carefully.

26:01.660 --> 26:02.660
This isn't a school.

26:02.740 --> 26:04.060
I don't charge you tuition.

26:04.220 --> 26:06.300
So I have no obligation
to teach any of you.

26:07.755 --> 26:08.940
I expect you to be here

26:09.820 --> 26:11.620
to create value for me.

26:11.740 --> 26:12.620
Lin Zhanqiao,

26:14.060 --> 26:16.740
I demand compensation
for emotional distress.

26:22.180 --> 26:22.610
Hot water.

26:22.610 --> 26:22.980
Should...

26:24.580 --> 26:26.100
Should we go in and take a look?

26:35.900 --> 26:37.060
Do you know, for the company

26:37.420 --> 26:38.140
and me,

26:39.180 --> 26:40.580
what a good story means?

26:41.311 --> 26:43.844
And what does it mean for me
to hand it over to you?

26:44.422 --> 26:45.700
At the End of Yue Lu Lights

26:45.700 --> 26:47.100
is such a great story,

26:47.100 --> 26:48.688
yet you couldn't even write it well.

26:49.140 --> 26:50.820
All the good material you wasted

26:51.460 --> 26:52.500
and my time and energy,

26:53.244 --> 26:55.000
are you going to compensate me for that?

26:57.340 --> 26:58.380
Make way.

27:00.580 --> 27:01.540
Lin Zhanqiao,

27:02.620 --> 27:04.420
please, just let me keep writing.

27:04.488 --> 27:05.250
- Enough.
- Calm down.

27:05.260 --> 27:06.340
- Give me a chance.
- Enough.

27:07.380 --> 27:08.820
This is the office. Get back to work.

27:13.820 --> 27:14.340
Alright.

27:14.711 --> 27:15.820
You've vented your anger,

27:16.020 --> 27:16.940
and the damage is done.

27:17.420 --> 27:18.140
Calm down first.

27:20.140 --> 27:21.300
Come, let's talk over here.

27:25.540 --> 27:25.820
Come.

27:28.300 --> 27:29.060
Is your hand okay?

27:29.540 --> 27:29.980
I'm fine.

27:33.500 --> 27:34.600
Let me add you on WeChat.

27:35.180 --> 27:36.140
If anything comes up,

27:36.140 --> 27:37.911
I'll communicate with Ms. Lin for you.

27:38.180 --> 27:40.250
Recently, she's been
under a lot of pressure.

27:40.250 --> 27:41.533
She's too eager to deliver results,

27:41.580 --> 27:43.088
so she's lost her balance a bit.

27:43.980 --> 27:44.300
I...

27:46.740 --> 27:47.940
I just want a project.

27:49.500 --> 27:50.180
That's all.

27:51.220 --> 27:51.620
Got it.

27:52.488 --> 27:54.755
It's not just Lin Zhanqiao
who has good projects.

27:54.940 --> 27:56.420
I can help find one for you too.

27:57.300 --> 27:58.340
You're a good author.

27:58.866 --> 27:59.860
You won't go unnoticed.

28:01.660 --> 28:02.100
Thank you.

28:29.022 --> 28:31.022
Why did you go looking for Zhugan Dalan?

28:31.844 --> 28:33.300
To make sure he leaves the company

28:33.300 --> 28:34.866
and doesn't cause any more trouble.

28:38.940 --> 28:40.620
Is this for preparing

28:40.755 --> 28:41.666
our future company?

28:43.940 --> 28:45.060
As an editor,

28:45.060 --> 28:46.666
having more authors means more options.

29:00.140 --> 29:08.340
(For dramatic effect. Do not imitate.)

29:14.755 --> 29:16.288
What happened to your foot?

29:17.100 --> 29:17.933
Why are you here?

29:18.180 --> 29:19.177
I'm here to see you.

29:21.220 --> 29:21.860
Congratulations.

29:21.911 --> 29:23.755
Hope your collaboration
with Dai Shan goes well.

29:23.844 --> 29:25.530
Shattered Six States
will reach new heights.

29:25.660 --> 29:26.820
It is going pretty well.

29:27.140 --> 29:28.300
Relaxed and easy.

29:30.260 --> 29:31.500
I'll drive you to the hospital.

29:31.800 --> 29:33.400
No need. I can handle it myself.

29:33.466 --> 29:34.850
Where are you going? I'll come with you.

29:34.860 --> 29:35.980
I said I don't need your help.

29:35.980 --> 29:36.977
I can handle it myself.

29:37.260 --> 29:38.340
I promise I won't help.

29:50.300 --> 29:51.740
Disinfect the burn with this first,

29:51.860 --> 29:53.022
and then apply the ointment.

29:53.311 --> 29:53.911
Thank you.

29:58.155 --> 29:59.444
You didn't even go to the hospital,

29:59.450 --> 30:00.866
so how did you know
what medicine to buy?

30:01.740 --> 30:02.800
It's not that serious.

30:07.100 --> 30:08.540
I heard that your Yue Lu, whatever,

30:08.733 --> 30:10.088
got returned by the platform?

30:10.644 --> 30:12.100
And you took it out on the author?

30:15.711 --> 30:17.244
If a good story isn't written well,

30:17.266 --> 30:19.155
it's normal for
the platform to return it.

30:19.755 --> 30:21.355
When it was first commissioned,

30:21.740 --> 30:23.260
they offered a very high price.

30:24.700 --> 30:25.340
I know.

30:27.980 --> 30:28.660
How do you know?

30:28.980 --> 30:30.300
Of course, I know.

30:30.740 --> 30:32.060
They dropped your project

30:32.260 --> 30:34.340
and paid a lot more to buy
my Shattered Six States.

30:34.622 --> 30:36.280
The contract will be
signed in a few days.

30:37.533 --> 30:38.888
I'm doing this for your own good.

30:39.060 --> 30:39.911
Think about it.

30:40.380 --> 30:41.660
You priced it so high,

30:41.660 --> 30:42.888
but the result doesn't match.

30:42.955 --> 30:45.520
If it gets worse as it goes on,
how will you respond to the platform?

30:45.540 --> 30:46.580
And for future projects,

30:46.711 --> 30:48.420
do you think
they'll still sign with you?

30:48.688 --> 30:51.570
What's important now? It's all about
cost reduction and efficiency now.

30:51.660 --> 30:53.460
Money has to be spent where it matters.

30:53.820 --> 30:54.180
Well,

30:54.300 --> 30:55.422
my Shattered Six States

30:55.500 --> 30:57.460
is much better than your mess,

30:57.460 --> 30:58.180
don't you think?

30:58.355 --> 30:59.420
Your Shattered Six States

30:59.420 --> 31:00.780
isn't even halfway done yet.

31:01.488 --> 31:02.720
Will it fall apart at the end?

31:03.140 --> 31:03.780
Who knows?

31:04.340 --> 31:05.100
Impossible.

31:06.140 --> 31:07.580
Because it's written by me, He Han.

31:41.700 --> 31:42.220
Ling Yikai,

31:45.060 --> 31:45.820
let's have dinner.

31:47.580 --> 31:48.555
Have you decided?

31:49.980 --> 31:51.300
Friendship or the market?

31:51.900 --> 31:52.820
Can I choose love?

31:56.060 --> 31:56.940
That's not an option.

31:57.220 --> 31:58.020
I added it myself.

31:58.820 --> 32:00.340
If we were in a relationship,

32:00.420 --> 32:01.977
then if you went out
to start a business,

32:02.000 --> 32:03.244
I would support you.

32:03.980 --> 32:05.911
I need to give Lin Zhanqiao
a reason to leave

32:06.140 --> 32:07.260
and also give myself one.

32:10.622 --> 32:11.955
Let me think about it.

32:13.355 --> 32:15.155
So, are we still having dinner?

32:15.220 --> 32:15.700
No appetite.

32:25.660 --> 32:27.100
(Mengtong Internet Cafe)

32:27.100 --> 32:28.220
- One more bowl.
- Coming right up.

32:28.220 --> 32:29.180
Okay, thank you, ma'am.

33:10.220 --> 33:10.540
Here.

33:11.460 --> 33:11.740
Here.

33:18.860 --> 33:19.660
Dear friends,

33:19.888 --> 33:22.155
(Shattered Six States Film Adaptation Signing Ceremony)
now let's give a warm welcome

33:22.222 --> 33:24.266
to the author
of Shattered Six States, He Han.

33:38.220 --> 33:39.940
Alright, for today's signing ceremony,

33:40.020 --> 33:41.140
as you can all see,

33:41.288 --> 33:43.355
the author
of Shattered Six States, He Han,

33:43.400 --> 33:44.580
has come in person

33:45.740 --> 33:47.700
to attend
the film adaptation licensing ceremony

33:48.020 --> 33:49.860
for the novel Shattered Six States.

33:50.100 --> 33:50.860
As we all know,

33:50.860 --> 33:52.540
this is He Han's second work this year

33:52.540 --> 33:54.540
to be adapted for the screen.

33:55.100 --> 33:56.980
(Texing Video)
From 2020 until now,

33:57.180 --> 33:58.740
(So excited!)
He Han's intellectual property can be

33:58.980 --> 34:01.100
(So handsome!)
said to guarantee blockbuster success.

34:01.340 --> 34:03.340
(Among the top five)

34:03.340 --> 34:05.380
(costume dramas in platform viewership,)

34:05.380 --> 34:06.500
(three of them)

34:06.620 --> 34:09.020
(are adapted from He Han's novels.)

34:09.180 --> 34:10.620
(So from the time He Han)

34:10.900 --> 34:12.700
(began writing Shattered Six States,)

34:13.100 --> 34:14.822
(we decided)

34:14.911 --> 34:16.466
at all costs

34:16.860 --> 34:17.780
to secure it.

34:17.860 --> 34:19.860
Can you reveal roughly
how much the rights fee is?

34:19.860 --> 34:20.700
(Congratulations!)

34:20.700 --> 34:21.820
(That's incredible!)

34:21.820 --> 34:22.540
Sky-high price.

34:23.180 --> 34:24.820
(Alright, the signing ceremony)

34:25.140 --> 34:26.420
(officially begins now.)

34:34.460 --> 34:36.220
Please sign the agreement.

34:40.444 --> 34:41.711
Let's move signings

34:41.733 --> 34:42.580
to the afternoon next time.

34:42.580 --> 34:44.300
It's too early.
I didn't even dare sleep.

34:47.180 --> 34:50.780
(Authorized Signatory He Han)

34:52.460 --> 34:53.700
Mr. He Han,

34:53.980 --> 34:55.100
with such a heavy workload,

34:55.100 --> 34:56.540
how do you keep it going?

34:56.733 --> 34:57.540
It's not that much.

34:57.540 --> 34:58.820
Isn't it just 10,000 words a day?

34:58.820 --> 34:59.977
What is there to keep up?

35:00.060 --> 35:01.380
In your opinion,

35:01.500 --> 35:03.020
what's the hardest part of writing?

35:03.380 --> 35:04.260
The hardest part...

35:04.260 --> 35:05.100
(Not bad!)

35:05.100 --> 35:06.220
(Just got here.)

35:06.220 --> 35:08.350
(He Han is amazing!)
It must be finding a good editor.

35:08.380 --> 35:09.700
Luckily, I've already found one.

35:09.955 --> 35:11.044
(Congratulations!)
Dai Shan.

35:15.380 --> 35:16.020
Mr. He Han,

35:16.620 --> 35:18.100
(if you had to use one sentence)

35:18.220 --> 35:20.220
(to describe your collaboration
with Ms. Dai,)

35:20.340 --> 35:21.300
what would you say?

35:27.380 --> 35:29.180
A meeting that makes

35:29.340 --> 35:31.380
the rest of the world fade away.

35:38.422 --> 35:41.688
Ms. Lin, furious as if she swallowed
a bomb, is about to show up.

35:42.740 --> 35:43.620
Turn off the sound.

35:43.700 --> 35:44.333
Turn it off.

35:44.355 --> 35:45.088
Shut it down.

35:50.020 --> 35:50.780
The sound...

36:03.140 --> 36:04.860
We are a content-producing company,

36:05.660 --> 36:06.820
not an agency

36:06.820 --> 36:08.500
with only He Han as a signed author.

36:09.100 --> 36:09.660
He's gone,

36:10.220 --> 36:11.300
but we are fully capable

36:11.300 --> 36:13.500
of producing content of equal quality.

36:13.980 --> 36:15.460
We still have many top authors.

36:15.660 --> 36:16.977
Recently, we've also spent money

36:17.060 --> 36:18.380
to sign many new authors.

36:18.580 --> 36:19.460
With so many people,

36:19.580 --> 36:21.955
I don't believe
that not one of them can beat He Han.

36:22.060 --> 36:23.660
I don't think he's untouchable.

36:25.980 --> 36:27.420
If in the time ahead,

36:27.420 --> 36:29.133
he still stays number one
on the rankings

36:29.180 --> 36:30.380
and never drops,

36:30.380 --> 36:32.580
then it only proves
our authors lack ability,

36:32.580 --> 36:34.955
our editors lack ability,
and Chenxing lacks ability.

36:36.460 --> 36:38.900
I completely agree
with what was just said.

36:39.540 --> 36:41.340
We surely have strong authors.

36:42.740 --> 36:44.100
He Han may be number one,

36:44.300 --> 36:45.780
but within the top 20,

36:45.780 --> 36:47.300
we still hold two spots.

36:48.300 --> 36:49.220
Also, this month,

36:49.220 --> 36:50.220
we sold two more

36:50.220 --> 36:52.540
film rights at good prices.

36:52.860 --> 36:53.740
The fact is,

36:53.740 --> 36:55.780
our entire company's
annual copyright revenue

36:55.900 --> 36:57.100
combined doesn't match

36:57.100 --> 36:59.444
what He Han signed this morning
for Shattered Six States.

36:59.466 --> 37:01.200
And Shattered Six States
is only partially updated.

37:01.288 --> 37:03.000
That's why we need you to step up.

37:03.100 --> 37:04.340
What content do you have

37:04.340 --> 37:06.244
that could compete
with Shattered Six States?

37:06.260 --> 37:07.088
We'll focus on them.

37:07.100 --> 37:08.290
At the End of Yue Lu Lights.

37:08.290 --> 37:09.700
You're bringing that up again.

37:13.340 --> 37:14.500
Give me some other names.

37:14.940 --> 37:15.500
What about

37:15.500 --> 37:17.220
those so-called "big shots"

37:17.220 --> 37:18.700
you all treat so carefully

37:18.700 --> 37:19.620
like fragile treasures?

37:20.740 --> 37:22.180
What progress have they made now?

37:22.244 --> 37:23.900
If you can beat your opponents,
you're a master.

37:23.900 --> 37:25.660
If you can beat He Han, you're a legend.

37:25.860 --> 37:26.780
Otherwise, don't keep

37:26.780 --> 37:28.733
talking to me about
special treatment for legends!

37:33.380 --> 37:33.940
Fragile.

37:34.780 --> 37:36.380
Tell me about the new authors first.

37:39.660 --> 37:41.300
You've already met the six new ones.

37:41.300 --> 37:43.066
They're competing with Homeward Fields.

37:43.300 --> 37:43.900
And these

37:44.377 --> 37:46.100
are the promising
new authors I've shortlisted

37:46.100 --> 37:47.540
over the past few months,

37:47.540 --> 37:49.020
their project summaries, and data.

37:51.460 --> 37:52.140
For the top 20,

37:52.377 --> 37:53.940
get their chapters one,
twenty, and eighty

37:53.940 --> 37:54.740
for me now.

37:54.933 --> 37:56.340
The top ten can all be interviewed.

37:56.350 --> 37:57.900
If any of them fit,
move forward immediately.

37:57.900 --> 37:58.260
Alright.

37:59.340 --> 37:59.900
Mr. He Han.

38:00.780 --> 38:01.420
Mr. He Han.

38:01.660 --> 38:03.220
There's a meeting going on inside.

38:03.420 --> 38:04.060
Let it.

38:05.980 --> 38:06.660
♪Never♪

38:11.340 --> 38:12.460
♪Never Stop♪

38:16.740 --> 38:17.860
♪Never Stop♪

38:22.044 --> 38:23.540
♪Watch my words come alive in bloom♪

38:23.540 --> 38:24.980
♪Unleash six states in a chain of blows♪

38:24.980 --> 38:26.140
♪See a genius born to soar♪

38:26.140 --> 38:27.700
♪Rising high where the wide skies glow♪

38:27.700 --> 38:28.820
♪If you can catch my shadow♪

38:28.820 --> 38:30.380
♪You can cross the world and roam free♪

38:30.380 --> 38:31.540
♪Your next stop in your heart♪

38:31.540 --> 38:33.100
♪Must be me at the top♪

38:33.100 --> 38:35.220
♪Neon lights glaring bright♪

38:35.220 --> 38:36.111
Congratulations.

38:36.377 --> 38:38.020
Another project sold at a high price.

38:38.460 --> 38:39.100
Two.

38:39.200 --> 38:40.580
The next one is already theirs too,

38:40.820 --> 38:42.580
just not officially announced yet.

38:43.660 --> 38:44.340
What's it called?

38:45.355 --> 38:46.288
Haven't decided.

38:46.740 --> 38:48.740
So basically, with your name,

38:49.060 --> 38:50.620
plus Dai Shan's support,

38:50.740 --> 38:52.010
and Mr. Fan backing it,

38:52.010 --> 38:53.400
they will take whatever you write?

38:54.140 --> 38:55.220
And it's all paid upfront.

38:56.460 --> 38:57.180
She knows it.

38:57.180 --> 38:58.800
She's a veteran editor of ten years.

39:01.260 --> 39:01.980
New girlfriend?

39:03.260 --> 39:03.820
This is Mimi.

39:03.888 --> 39:05.300
She's also an online fiction author.

39:05.340 --> 39:06.540
This is my ex, Lin Zhanqiao.

39:06.820 --> 39:08.540
Top promoter, and top editor.

39:08.550 --> 39:09.450
Get to know each other.

39:09.450 --> 39:11.340
If she signs you, your future is set.

39:11.580 --> 39:12.400
I don't want that.

39:12.977 --> 39:14.266
I only want to sign with you.

39:16.940 --> 39:18.820
See, fate works in unexpected ways

39:18.820 --> 39:19.340
sometimes.

39:20.900 --> 39:22.900
A gentleman is drawn to a graceful lady.

39:29.340 --> 39:31.060
Although Dai Shan
doesn't quite like Mimi,

39:31.180 --> 39:32.540
beautiful women

39:32.660 --> 39:33.900
rarely get along.

39:34.220 --> 39:35.300
So today, you and...

39:35.700 --> 39:36.140
Mimi.

39:38.340 --> 39:39.140
What's the occasion?

39:39.540 --> 39:40.660
Just in a good mood.

39:40.660 --> 39:41.940
Came to see you, my old friend.

39:42.740 --> 39:44.100
Just so happens I'm busy today.

39:44.177 --> 39:45.733
What could you possibly be busy with?

39:45.780 --> 39:47.900
You don't even have
a single promising author.

39:48.660 --> 39:49.580
How can you say that?

39:49.820 --> 39:51.222
Know yourself and your enemy, right?

39:51.780 --> 39:52.740
He Han's name

39:52.740 --> 39:54.860
is a mountain they can't cross.

39:56.222 --> 39:57.460
The only one worth mentioning

39:58.380 --> 40:00.380
is the one called Ouyang Feng.

40:00.580 --> 40:01.300
Hong Qigong.

40:01.740 --> 40:02.780
Hong Qigong, sorry.

40:03.580 --> 40:05.300
Too bad she doesn't
plan to renew with you.

40:09.660 --> 40:11.900
A few years ago, I found her story

40:12.660 --> 40:13.900
on a second-hand site.

40:14.860 --> 40:16.860
I took her from a complete beginner

40:17.380 --> 40:19.180
all the way to a top-tier author.

40:20.500 --> 40:21.340
Seems like

40:21.780 --> 40:23.420
she's not the first

40:23.620 --> 40:24.940
to leave you.

40:25.260 --> 40:26.580
And she won't be the last.

40:33.740 --> 40:34.180
But

40:34.900 --> 40:36.020
don't feel too bad.

40:36.466 --> 40:39.155
Graduating from kindergarten
to primary school, changing teachers

40:39.200 --> 40:40.180
is perfectly normal.

40:42.260 --> 40:43.260
How do you know that?

40:43.777 --> 40:45.260
Your partner, Zhao Lanxin, told me.

40:45.620 --> 40:46.820
Why didn't she tell me?

40:46.911 --> 40:48.820
Because she and
your other partner, Ling Yikai,

40:48.900 --> 40:50.100
are planning to leave you

40:50.180 --> 40:51.555
and start something new together.

41:06.740 --> 41:07.220
Impossible.

41:09.780 --> 41:10.820
Believe it or not.

41:10.955 --> 41:12.660
They came to me to discuss cooperation,

41:12.660 --> 41:13.700
offering me shares.

41:13.900 --> 41:14.660
I turned them down.

41:15.180 --> 41:15.860
In my opinion,

41:16.340 --> 41:17.460
you may not be great,

41:17.620 --> 41:18.780
but they're even worse.

41:19.940 --> 41:20.300
Fine.

41:20.377 --> 41:21.888
If you can't handle it, come find me.

41:21.940 --> 41:23.244
I'll arrange a new job for you.

41:23.620 --> 41:23.980
Let's go.

41:24.100 --> 41:24.980
Thanks for the offer.

41:25.300 --> 41:26.820
In terms of performance

41:27.380 --> 41:28.060
and reputation,

41:28.660 --> 41:30.580
I'm among the best in the industry.

41:34.980 --> 41:36.500
That's because you got lucky.

41:36.900 --> 41:38.700
Back then, your partner was me.

41:40.060 --> 41:41.580
I'll find someone better than you.

41:43.300 --> 41:44.500
I actually quite admire

41:44.500 --> 41:45.980
your confidence and courage.

41:46.700 --> 41:48.355
Better than stupidity and ignorance.

41:50.020 --> 41:50.980
Alright, let's go.

41:51.620 --> 41:51.980
Let's go.

41:52.111 --> 41:53.580
The hotel across from
the company just opened.

41:53.580 --> 41:54.600
I'm planning to move there.

41:54.660 --> 41:56.460
If you need anything,
just let me know. Bye.

42:05.300 --> 42:06.100
Mr. He Han.

42:07.180 --> 42:07.900
Mr. He Han,

42:08.220 --> 42:09.340
I'm your fan.

42:09.460 --> 42:10.730
Can I get your autograph?

42:10.730 --> 42:11.180
Of course.

42:12.780 --> 42:13.220
Tell me,

42:14.500 --> 42:17.020
if Ling Yikai and
Zhao Lanxin go independent,

42:17.820 --> 42:19.020
will you go with them

42:19.460 --> 42:21.460
or stay here and fight it out
with Lin Zhanqiao?

42:29.540 --> 42:30.980
Hey, don't say that.

42:32.380 --> 42:35.820
If Ling Yikai and Zhao Lanxin
go independent...

42:44.180 --> 42:45.500
Is what He Han said true?

42:45.980 --> 42:46.620
Why?

42:47.260 --> 42:48.820
Is there a problem at work?

42:55.460 --> 42:56.222
Marry me.

42:57.266 --> 42:59.222
This is the second time
I'm proposing to you.

43:05.740 --> 43:07.260
And you still claim
you didn't seduce my husband?

43:07.460 --> 43:08.140
Not before.

43:09.060 --> 43:09.620
But I am now.

43:13.780 --> 43:14.820
No matter how great he is,

43:16.060 --> 43:17.020
he just doesn't like you.

43:17.420 --> 43:18.940
How many people actually marry for love?

43:19.460 --> 43:20.900
And is everyone
who marries for love happy?

43:26.460 --> 43:28.220
I love seeing you grit your teeth

43:28.220 --> 43:29.580
while losing to me.

43:30.540 --> 43:31.660
Remember to check my update tonight.

43:35.401 --> 43:36.521
(I've been thinking.)

43:37.801 --> 43:41.081
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:41.841 --> 43:49.171
(is probably different.)

43:50.171 --> 43:51.921
♪If the sky♪

43:52.431 --> 43:53.831
♪And the sea♪

43:54.371 --> 43:56.081
♪Turned upside down♪

43:57.641 --> 43:59.571
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:59.971 --> 44:03.361
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

44:05.131 --> 44:07.101
♪If back then♪

44:07.461 --> 44:11.871
♪We had never let go♪

44:12.471 --> 44:18.751
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

44:19.871 --> 44:22.021
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

44:22.021 --> 44:23.891
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

44:24.071 --> 44:26.511
♪And found our way back whole♪

44:27.351 --> 44:29.521
♪So let this surging love♪

44:29.521 --> 44:33.951
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:34.851 --> 44:37.031
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:37.031 --> 44:38.121
♪That's alright♪

44:38.661 --> 44:39.411
♪If we're buried♪

44:39.411 --> 44:42.111
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:42.371 --> 44:44.551
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:44.731 --> 44:49.151
♪This one eternal photograph♪

45:04.911 --> 45:07.201
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

45:07.201 --> 45:08.961
♪Running in opposite ways♪

45:09.081 --> 45:11.551
♪Searching all along the way♪

45:12.351 --> 45:14.511
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

45:14.701 --> 45:19.611
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

45:19.611 --> 45:23.131
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

45:23.371 --> 45:24.341
♪Only after loss♪

45:24.341 --> 45:26.971
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

45:27.381 --> 45:29.741
♪In another time and space♪

45:29.741 --> 45:31.301
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:31.301 --> 45:34.131
♪Till we grow old♪

45:35.091 --> 45:37.381
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:37.381 --> 45:40.051
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:42.571 --> 45:44.981
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:44.981 --> 45:50.191
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
